WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Email promotions”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Email promotions
From the menu choose Email promotions and review the options for creating an offer.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Prepare the content and audience
Write the subject and content and choose the right recipients among those who agreed to be contacted.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Review before confirming
Review the email, the links, the audience and any cost shown before you confirm sending.
